  <title>Charts</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Charts</gui></guiseq> draws a chart over
  time. Choose how to <gui>Group by</gui>: by day, week, month, quarter or
  year.</p>

  <terms>
    <item><title><gui>Invoice amounts</gui></title>
    <p><gui>Invoice chart</gui> draws the total invoiced in each
    period.</p></item>
    <item><title><gui>Products</gui></title>
    <p>Choose a product, then <gui>Sold</gui> for how many were invoiced in
    each period, or <gui>Purchased</gui> for how many were ordered.</p></item>
  </terms>

  <p>Each chart opens in a window of its own, with buttons to zoom, move
  around and save it as a picture.</p>

</page>
